# Optional: copy as switch/gtav-scripthook/runtime.ini on your SD card.
# Restart GTA after editing. Remove a key to use the runtime build's default.
# Standard defaults: 8 resident NROs, 16 script slots, 8 MiB plugin budget.
# Values are nonnegative whole numbers; 0 selects automatic capacity per key.
# Uncomment only the settings you want to override:
# resident_limit=8
# script_slots=16
# plugin_memory_mib=8
# Per-module image/BSS settings use MiB; defaults remain 2 MiB.
# Raising a module cap does not change the shared plugin accounting budget.
# module_image_mib=2
# module_bss_mib=2
